# board.pdl - Teario-Play: MODE walk (game_core realtime kind). The level is read from the SHARED Teario folder; its text is part of the rules hash, so editing the level after a run began refuses that run's ledger.
# LEVEL | file | <path relative to this app>   the level file (format: ../teario/levels/first-steps.pdl; the same bytes Teario-Make exports)
# LEVEL | solid | <tile characters>              the tiles the hero cannot enter (the legend is ../teario/tiles.pdl)
# NO PHYSICS YET: each tick the hero moves one column along the START row by its input (left, right, stay); a solid tile stops it; reaching the GOAL column wins.
MODE  | platform
LEVEL | file  | ../teario/levels/meadow.pdl
LEVEL | solid | #
